 Browse folders › Fix old rules                                       here: C:\Projects\quiz-slayer

 E:\usb\old-client will no longer have its own Vercel rule. It and every folder inside it will use
 default (you@personal.example), like everywhere else.

 Devpit will write:
   ~/AppData/Roaming/devpit/accounts.toml (removes)
     [[rule]]
     folder = 'E:\usb\old-client'
     vercel = "client"

